              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/MAN_AG\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MAN AG\">MAN</a> Concept truck with <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Bernard_Krone_Holding\" title=\"Category:Bernard Krone Holding\">Krone</a> Trailer AeroLiner.\nThe vehicle offers the loading volume of a conventional truck; nevertheless, it shows the low <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drag_coefficient\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Drag coefficient\">drag coefficient</a> of a passenger car. Length of the whole train: 20.4 metres. The trailer was moved on highways; however, the truck itself cannot be driven on public roads. Photo taken at exhibition <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=IAA&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"IAA (page does not exist)\">IAA</a> 2012 in Hanover, Germany. Internationale Automobil-Ausstellung <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=IAA&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"IAA (page does not exist)\">IAA</a> 2012, Hannover.",
